+# GP2EAF - Pac-Man World 2 : 16:9 baked into the DOL
+#
+#    58 data/constant writes
+#   101 cave words at 0x8020C57C (404 bytes of 4004)
+#    20 'b <cave>' hooks = 13 wiki + 7 added
+#
+# Every 'fmr f4,f3' in the binary was enumerated (34) and grouped by the
+# draw function its following bl reaches. Two functions matter:
+#   0x8007095C - 6 sites, all 6 hooked by the wiki code (complete)
+#   0x80070934 - 9 sites, only 2 hooked by the wiki code; the other 7
+#                are added here. Missing them left the front-end menu
+#                and other 2D elements stretched.
+# The remaining 19 sites call unrelated functions and are left alone.
+
+[OnFrame]
