+// ModernGekko port feature: scene-aware native 16:9 for Pac-Man World 2.
+//
+// The widescreen DOL patch routes every projection/2D scale through constants
+// in guest RAM (0x8000328C/90/94 + 55 data values). This module rewrites those
+// constants at runtime depending on the current game scene, discovered through
+// the per-state update-callback pointer the main loop dispatches through:
+// gameplay gets true anamorphic 16:9 (presented ForceWide), front-end menus /
+// title / loading render their original 4:3 layout (presented ForceStandard).
+//
+// Arms itself only when the game is GP2E *and* the code cave from the patch is
+// present in memory; on a pristine DOL it stays inert.
+#pragma once
+
+namespace Core
+{
+class System;
+}
+
+namespace PMW2WS
+{
+// Called once per completed VI field from the CPU thread.
+void OnField(Core::System& system);
+
+}  // namespace PMW2WS
